    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Excellent Condition Throughout\r\nCorner Property with Large Driveway\r\nHighly Sought After Residential Area\r\nBeautifully Appointed Interior \r\nNew Sleek Modern Kitchen with Island\r\nB Ber Rating\r\nSunny South Facing Garden\r\nGas Central Heating"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway: Large bright spacious hallway with tiled flooring\r\nGuest WC: Tiled flooring with wc, whb and storage unit\r\nUtility Room: Tiled flooring with countertop space and shelving. Housing Ideal logic gas boiler\r\nKitchen: Beautifully appointed sleek modern kitchen with quartz countertops. Also included is a superb kitchen Island with quartz countertop, storage and seating.\r\nDining Room: Wooden flooring. Double doors leading to sunny south facing garden.\r\nLiving Room: Large bright spacious livingroom. Open fire with cast iron and wood surround. Wooden flooring.\r\nBedroom 1: Large spacious double bedroom. Carpeted with standalone wardrobes\r\nEnsuite: Fully tiled bathroom. Shower cubicle with electric Triton shower. whb and wc.\r\nBedroom 2: Large double bedroom with wooden flooring and built in wardrobes.\r\nBedroom 3: Double bedroom with wooden flooring and standalone wardrobes\r\nMain Bathroom: Fully tiled main bathroom. Bath with overhead shower. whb with under storage and wc.\r\nBedroom 4: Single bedroom with wooden flooring and built in wardrobe\r\nOutside:\r\n\r\nFront:  Corner property with large walled driveway and ample parking. Not overlooked facing large green space. \r\nRear:  Sunny South West facing garden. Part decking, part lawned. Walled and fenced with large barna shed. An array of flower beds, apple and maple tree."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Murphy Mullan are delighted to present this wonderful opportunity to acquire this fantastic four bed home to the market.\r\n\r\nThis property has many upgrades including an open plan kitchen/dining room with a beautifully appointed sleek modern kitchen with quartz countertops. Also included is a superb kitchen Island with quartz countertop, storage and seating. The property also benefits from a sunny south facing rear garden. To the front the property benefits from a corner site with a large driveway not overlooked and facing a green.\r\n\r\n25 Hazelbury Park is close to a host of excellent local schools.  It is located close to Blanchardstown Shopping Centre and Clonee Village with all their abundant amenities. Dublin Airport is approximately a 20 minute drive.  The Navan Road, N3 and M50 Motorway are easily accessible.  There is also an excellent bus service providing easy access to City Centre. Hansfield Train Station is also located within 15 minutes walk.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of hallway, downstairs wc, utility room, livingroom, kitchen/diningroom, four bedrooms, three double bedrooms including Master bedroom with en-suite, single bedroom and main bathroom.\r\n\r\nOutside there is a large walled driveway facing a large green space not overlooked.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended!"
      },
      {
